p areas. Specialized teams are evaluating important industrial and commercial regions for mismatches, with a goal to update assessments and recover unpaid dues wherever applicable.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/regulatory/belagavi-civic-body-cracks-down-on-tax-evasion-begins-property-remeasurements/133704070?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-178994/133704070.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "regulatory"}]}